alan*) = Firstly\n   - **ثُمَّ** (*thumma*) = Then / Next (with a slight time lapse)\n   - **بَعْدَ ذَلِكَ** (*baʿda dhālik*) = After that\n   - **فِي النِّهَايَةِ** (*fī an-nihāyah*) = In the end / Finally\n   - **أَخِيراً** (*'akhīran*) = Finally / At last\n\n3. The Connector 'Fa-' (فَـ):\n   - **فَـ** (*fa-*) attached to a verb means 'and so / and then immediately' (immediate consequence without time gap):\n     - *وَصَلْنَا فَأَكَلْنَا.* (*Waṣalnā fa-'akalnā.* - We arrived and immediately ate.)",
