- **دِينَار** (*dīnār*) = Dinar (Kuwait, Jordan, Bahrain, Tunisia, Algeria, Iraq)\n\n3. Asking for Sizes & Trying Items On:\n   - **المَقَاس** (*al-maqās*) = size (*'ما مقاسك؟'* - What is your size? / *'مقاس متوسط / كبير'* - medium/large)\n   - **هَلْ يُمْكِنُ أَنْ أُجَرِّبَهُ؟** (*Hal yumkin 'an 'ujarribah?*) = May I try it on? (*جَرَّبَ* = to try/test)\n   - **غُرْفَةُ القِيَاس / غُرْفَةُ التَّبْدِيل** (*ghurfat al-qiyās*) = fitting room / changing room\n   - **يُنَاسِبُنِي جِدًّا** (*yunāsibunī jiddan*) = It suits me / fits me very well!",
