فَوْقَ (fawqa)**: above / on top of\n   - **تَحْتَ (taḥta)**: under / below\n   - **بِجَانِبِ (bi-jānib) / قُرْبَ (qurba)**: beside / next to / near\n   - **أَمَامَ (amāma)**: in front of\n   - **خَلْفَ (khalfa) / وَرَاءَ (warā'a)**: behind\n   - **فِي (fī)**: in / inside\n   - *Rule*: The noun following a spatial preposition is in the **Genitive Case (مَجْرُور / majrūr with kasra)**:\n     - *الكِتَابُ فَوْقَ الطَّاوِلَةِ.* (The book is on top of the table.)\n     - *الأَرِيكَةُ أَمَامَ التِّلْفَازِ.* (The sofa is in front of the television.)",
