n / Counter: 〜売り場** (*-uriba*):\n     - *靴売り場* (*kutsu uriba*) = shoe section\n     - *化粧品売り場* (*keshōhin uriba*) = cosmetics section\n     - *免税カウンター* (*menzei kauntā*) = duty-free tax refund counter",
