s **を**:\n     - *角**を**右に曲がります (kado **o** migi ni magarimasu = Turn right **at/around** the corner)*\n     - *橋**を**渡ります (hashi **o** watarimasu = Cross **over** the bridge)*\n     - *公園**を**歩きます (kouen **o** arukimasu = Walk **through** the park)*.",
