racters with extreme vocal modulation;\n  - **Shamisen (三味線)**: Driving emotional tempo with heavy ivory plectrum (*Bachi*);\n  - **Sannin-zukai (三人遣い - 3-Person Puppetry)**: Omozukai (head & right arm), Hidarizukai (left arm), Ashizukai (legs/feet).",
