olic paraboloid concrete walls clad in stainless steel forming a giant cross visible from the sky;\n  - **Tokyo Metropolitan Government Building (東京都庁舎 - Shinjuku 1991)**: Twin towers echoing Gothic cathedrals and Japanese digital microchips.",
