ard spiral and spiritual endurance of a court lady starring **Kinuyo Tanaka (田中絹代)**;\n    - **『雨月物語』(Ugetsu - 1953 - Venice Silver Lion)**: Ethereal ghost masterpiece set on a misty Biwa lake in wartime;\n    - **『山椒大夫』(Sansho the Bailiff - 1954)**: Legendary moral drama of fraternal devotion and compassion (*\"Without mercy, man is like a beast\"*).",
