:\n  - **Броненосец «Потёмкин» (Battleship Potemkin - 1925)**: The iconic **Odessa Steps sequence (Одесская лестница)** where tsarist soldiers fire upon civilians, culminating in the baby carriage tumbling down the grand stairs;\n  - **Александр Невский (Alexander Nevsky - 1938)**: The Battle on the Ice on frozen Lake Peipus with the immortal orchestral score composed in direct audiovisual counterpoint by **Sergei Prokofiev**;\n  - **Иван Грозный (Ivan the Terrible - 1944/1946)** starring Nikolai Cherkasov.",
