mped and folded around the finger into a tight crescent \"ear\";\n  - **Boiling & Serving**: Boiled in salted water with whole bay leaves and black peppercorns, served with **clarified butter, a dish of raw vinegar (уксус), and freshly cracked black pepper** (or sour cream).",
